{
  "name": "Grappling Strike",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to attempt to grapple the target. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll, and if the target is no more than 1 size larger than you, it must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed save, the target becomes Grappled by you.</p>",
